msgid "The volume name follows the project directory's name; check it with <code>docker volume ls</code>. Skipping the <code>ca clean</code> leaves the CA holding a signed certificate for <code>openvoxdb</code> with no key to match, and the fresh start fails with <code>No keypair on disk and CA already has signed certificate</code>."
msgstr "El nombre del volumen sigue el nombre del directorio del proyecto; compruébelo con <code>docker volume ls</code>. Si se salta el <code>ca clean</code>, la CA conserva un certificado firmado para <code>openvoxdb</code> sin clave que le corresponda, y el nuevo arranque falla con <code>No keypair on disk and CA already has signed certificate</code>."

